    "timeline_A9JrwR": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "timeline_rDfw3F": {
          "type": "timeline",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4d8fbbf49aab8_img20180330wa0076.jpg.999xx.jpg",
            "img_pos": "left",
            "image_ratio": "ratio1_1",
            "image_position": "8",
            "image_size": "cover",
            "img_effect": "none",
            "b_effect": "none",
            "step_label": "2009",
            "sub_heading": "The start of the journey",
            "heading": "Meet The Honey Man",
            "description": "<p>I’m Riath, better known as the <strong>“Honey Man”</strong>—a title earned through my unwavering passion for raw, unadulterated honey. With Yemeni roots and born in South Yorkshire, I grew up savouring the rich, golden nectar my parents brought back from their homeland—a taste so pure, it became a lifelong obsession. But when I searched for the same authenticity in the market, I found only disappointment. That frustration sparked a mission: <strong>to bring the world’s finest raw honey to those who crave the real thing.</strong> And so, Balqees was born—a journey to champion purity, tradition, and the incredible flavours of raw honey, straight from the source.</p>",
            "url": "",
            "btn_label": "Read more",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        },
        "timeline_VEiXFX": {
          "type": "timeline",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MAP-RED-SEA.webp",
            "img_pos": "right",
            "image_ratio": "ratioadapt",
            "image_position": "8",
            "image_size": "cover",
            "img_effect": "none",
            "b_effect": "none",
            "step_label": "",
            "sub_heading": "The story behind the name",
            "heading": "Balqees Honey",
            "description": "<p>The name Balqees comes from a beloved Queen of the Arabian Felix in the territory known as present day Yemen. Queen Balqees was also famously known as the Queen of Sheba who reigned in the 9th century BC. Legend has it she was also a big fan of honey!</p>",
            "url": "",
            "btn_label": "Read more",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        },
        "timeline_PHJLJD": {
          "type": "timeline",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/yemeni_sidr_image.webp",
            "img_pos": "left",
            "image_ratio": "ratioadapt",
            "image_position": "8",
            "image_size": "cover",
            "img_effect": "none",
            "b_effect": "none",
            "step_label": "",
            "sub_heading": "The Signature Honey",
            "heading": "Yemeni Sidr",
            "description": "<p>This honey was the one i grew up on. Savouring that rich butterscotch taste for the first time in my life was a transformative experience which would later inspire me to search for it once more. Many types of raw honey have health and medicinal qualities, but Sidr Honey in particular has an abundance of minerals, vitamins and other nutrients which makes it even more potent.</p>",
            "url": "",
            "btn_label": "Read more",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        },
        "timeline_FfTU84": {
          "type": "timeline",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/458436318_2370856083061312_7150997878224563159_n.jpg",
